# BuildKit picks up "<dockerfile>.dockerignore" in preference to a root
# .dockerignore, so this keeps the build context small without adding a file to
# the repo root. Build from the repo root:
#
#   docker build -f web/Dockerfile -t fot-web .
*
!web/app.py
!web/requirements.txt
!web/templates
!web/data
!fot
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
